1
00:00:00,009 --> 00:00:01,679
(Sheldon:)It bothers me.

2
00:00:02,886 --> 00:00:06,386
(Howard:)-Sheldon, this is a summons.
-A summons? For what?

3
00:00:06,557 --> 00:00:08,267
Looks like you ran a red light...

4
00:00:08,475 --> 00:00:13,355
...on Marengo Avenue at 9:30 p.m.
on November 16th.

5
00:00:13,731 --> 00:00:17,231
They got you on a traffic camera.
Nice picture.

6
00:00:21,739 --> 00:00:25,579
November 16th? Penny, that's
the evening you fell in your bathtub.

7
00:00:25,743 --> 00:00:27,823
(Sheldon:)I had to drive you
to the emergency room.

8
00:00:27,995 --> 00:00:29,205
(Penny:)No, it isn't.

9
00:00:30,080 --> 00:00:32,540
(Sheldon:)-Yes, it is.
-No, it isn't.

10
00:00:32,708 --> 00:00:36,248
I have an eidetic memory. That's
a picture of you in the passenger seat...

11
00:00:36,420 --> 00:00:38,840
(Sheldon:)...holding your dislocated shoulder.

12
00:00:39,006 --> 00:00:40,216
Hmm. No, it isn't.

13
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:45,050
(Sheldon:)Okay, then why is a summons
for a traffic violation...

14
00:00:45,220 --> 00:00:49,470
(Sheldon:)...committed in your car, bearing
your license plates, coming to me?

15
00:00:49,641 --> 00:00:51,681
[DRAMATIC MUSIC
PLAYING OVER SPEAKER]

16
00:00:54,521 --> 00:00:56,271
(Penny:)Okay, look, they sent me the ticket.

17
00:00:56,440 --> 00:01:00,110
(Penny:)I told them I wasn't driving,
and they were all, "Who was it?"

